OPIPP - Open PIPP
=================

The engine, formats and processing pipeline are new code, written from black-box measurement and annotated decompilation of the original. The WinForms front-end is a port of the decompiled user-interface layout rather than a clean-room design. No original source code, binaries or decompiled listings are redistributed with this repository.

This repository is an independent reimplementation of the command-line and processing
behaviour of PIPP (Planetary Imaging PreProcessor), originally written by Chris Garry.

